<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify">Operating lease expenses amounted to
$<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3n3_c20230101__20230930_z5Cxc1DdIKH7" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">82</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3n3_c20230701__20230930_zjy7F7SSRNC6" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2023-07-012023-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">31</ix:nonFraction></span> for the nine and three months ended September 30, 2023, respectively. Operating lease expenses amounted to $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20220930_ziT2dw5nCVYb" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">77</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3n3_c20220701__20220930_zypetWIqxPQi" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2022-07-012022-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">26</ix:nonFraction></span> for
the nine and three months ended September 30, 2022, respectively.</p>

