</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-09-30" escape="true" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80F_eus-gaap--SubsequentEventsTextBlock_z0jQl7IxGYoh" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">NOTE 10: <span id="xdx_820_zeOXXB7g9KW7">SUBSEQUENT EVENTS</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.75in"></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">1.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">On October 7, 2023, subsequent to the reporting period, the State of Israel suffered a surprise attack,
which led to the declaration of the &#8216;Iron Swords&#8217; War (the &#8220;War&#8221;). The War is on-going as of the issuance date
of these financial statements. Consequently, the Company&#8217;s operations were disrupted due to the recruitment of some of the Company&#8217;s
employees, including Gix Media&#8217;s CEO, to the army reserves.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 71.85pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 71.85pt; text-align: justify">Based on its assessment, the Company
expects a negative effect on its results of operations in the fourth quarter of 2023 due to the War, which its extent cannot be estimated
at this stage.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 71.85pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.75in"></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">2.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">On October 10, 2023, Gix Media and Leumi entered into an
                                                                                                                                                    addendum to an existing loan agreement between the parties, dated October 13, 2021. As part of the addendum to the loan agreement,
                                                                                                                                                    Leumi extended an existing monthly renewable credit line of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LineOfCredit_iI_pn3n3_c20231010__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--GixMediaAndLeumiMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zCHNUFVBl6me" title="Line of credit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" contextRef="AsOf2023-10-10_custom_GixMediaAndLeumiMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">3,500</ix:nonFraction></span>
                                                                                                                                                    (the &#8220;Gix Media Credit Line&#8221;) by one year which will expire on <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_c20231009__20231010__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--GixMediaAndLeumiMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_z8KKnEuazWXg" title="Debt instrument, maturity date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-10-092023-10-10_custom_GixMediaAndLeumiMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">October
                                                                                                                                                    13, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The amounts that are drawn from the Gix Media Credit Line bear an annual interest of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentDescription_c20231009__20231010__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--GixMediaAndLeumiMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zsILnhlNBhal" title="Debt instrument, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-10-092023-10-10_custom_GixMediaAndLeumiMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentDescription">SOFR
                                                                                                                                                    + 4.05%</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</td></tr></table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_81A_z8bk3X71Bqli" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 71.85pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p>


